Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:11.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}记得我们共度的时光和你给的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:16.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}尽管一切皆已改变
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:21.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}你仍是推进我活下去的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:37.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}自比海还深的底层 守护着离别的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:44.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}尽管我思念你 我却仍爱着你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.29,0:22:52.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}在持续到永远的悲伤黑夜中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:57.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}爱会活在其中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:03.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}为了你 我会在这里直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:10.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}我现在仍旧在许着愿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:21.02,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\b1\an5\frz270\fade(100,300)\pos(1850,540)}在这温暖的黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:06.65,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}I still remember you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:11.53,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}The time we shared the love you gave
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:16.62,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}Though everything has changed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:21.29,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}You push me to live on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:37.13,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}海よりも深い 奥底から 見守っている別れた以来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:44.29,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}I still love you even though I miss you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.29,0:22:52.65,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}永久に続く悲しみの世の中で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:57.82,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}愛は生きる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:03.92,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}I will be here for you always and forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:10.00,EDjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an5\frz270\pos(68,540)\fade(100,300)}今もずっと願ってるよ
